{"4735420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sage: Psychic Spy", "steam_appid": 4735420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Sage, a Psychic Spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new crime lord has entered the city, and he’s targeting your childhood friend. Answers lead to questions and relationships lead to conspiracies. Tensions are rising, and a gang war is becoming inevitable. You are the only one who can stop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, and disaster strikes. Succeed, and the world will never know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735420/extras/717c51e14f5a1a823a4cf0726389cfb2.avif?t=1781392594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735420/extras_big/717c51e14f5a1a823a4cf0726389cfb2.avif?t=1781392594 width=1560 height=2324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Mind Is Your Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use psychic superpowers to see enemies through walls. Read minds to gain intel about objectives, locations and enemies. Use telekinesis to distract enemies, steal keycards, or knock out opponents. You are outnumbered but never outmatched, use your psychic abilities to gain an advantage over your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Mission, Your Rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear levels with interconnected paths. Explore a world that gives you multiple options, from vents to catwalks, there's always another way to complete the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Superhero Stealth Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak  through thrilling locations, from a cartel casino to the offices of an evil billionaire. Fight off gangsters and mercenaries as you attempt to prevent two powerful factions from sparking a chaotic gangwar. All with beautiful cel-shaded graphics, inspired by comics from the 2000's!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735420/extras/4414b0ac167da2544ce8c9399fc50bf5.avif?t=1781392594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735420/extras_big/4414b0ac167da2544ce8c9399fc50bf5.avif?t=1781392594 width=1560 height=2018 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Sage, a Psychic Spy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new crime lord has entered the city, and he’s targeting your childhood friend. Answers lead to questions and relationships lead to conspiracies. Tensions are rising, and a gang war is becoming inevitable. You are the only one who can stop it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, and disaster strikes. Succeed, and the world will never know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735420/extras/717c51e14f5a1a823a4cf0726389cfb2.avif?t=1781392594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735420/extras_big/717c51e14f5a1a823a4cf0726389cfb2.avif?t=1781392594 width=1560 height=2324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Mind Is Your Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use psychic superpowers to see enemies through walls. Read minds to gain intel about objectives, locations and enemies. Use telekinesis to distract enemies, steal keycards, or knock out opponents. You are outnumbered but never outmatched, use your psychic abilities to gain an advantage over your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Mission, Your Rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear levels with interconnected paths. Explore a world that gives you multiple options, from vents to catwalks, there's always another way to complete the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Superhero Stealth Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak  through thrilling locations, from a cartel casino to the offices of an evil billionaire. Fight off gangsters and mercenaries as you attempt to prevent two powerful factions from sparking a chaotic gangwar. All with beautiful cel-shaded graphics, inspired by comics from the 2000's!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735420/extras/4414b0ac167da2544ce8c9399fc50bf5.avif?t=1781392594\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735420/extras_big/4414b0ac167da2544ce8c9399fc50bf5.avif?t=1781392594 width=1560 height=2018 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A stealth action-adventure game where your mind is your weapon. Play as Sage, a psychic spy investigating a new drug cartel in Krad City. Sneak deep into enemy territory, read minds to gain intel, and use telekinesis to manipulate your enemies and environment.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735420/74951b877d43686b4966a3335ce5ba1049da02bd/header.jpg?t=1781392594", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4735420/0fed3cbf25a2c1a41fd7222c3d861294eb475f46/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781392